WEBVTT

00:12:28.160 --> 00:12:30.245
You go down there, you take a bus --

00:12:30.245 --> 00:12:32.623
free, electric, self-driving.

00:12:32.664 --> 00:12:35.417
The local bus co-op uses
a powerful predictive algorithm

00:12:35.459 --> 00:12:37.961
to determine how much supply
is needed at what time

00:12:37.961 --> 00:12:40.547
for optimal efficiency and effectiveness.

00:12:40.589 --> 00:12:43.383
Compare that to rush hour in LA or London.

00:12:43.717 --> 00:12:46.053
Big difference -- I know which I prefer.

00:12:46.094 --> 00:12:47.930
You end up at the local health clinic.

00:12:47.930 --> 00:12:50.224
They say, "Look, it's time
for liquid biopsy.

00:12:50.224 --> 00:12:51.934
You missed your checkup last week."

00:12:51.934 --> 00:12:54.269
You go in -- stage zero cancer.

00:12:54.269 --> 00:12:57.147
No problem, some pills will fix that.

00:12:58.357 --> 00:13:00.567
At every stage of this narrative,